---
// src/components/CareersProcess.astro
import './CareersProcess.css';
---

<section class="careers-process" id="interview-process">
  <div class="process-container">
    
    <div class="process-header">
      <span class="section-label">How We Hire</span>
      <h2>Our Interview Process</h2>
      <p>We believe in a transparent, respectful, and efficient hiring process. We know you are balancing university and work, so we keep things straightforward and move quickly.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-steps">
      
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">01</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Application Review</h3>
          <span class="step-timeline">1 - 3 Business Days</span>
          <p>Our founding team personally reviews every CV and portfolio. We look for genuine passion, foundational skills, and a strong desire to learn.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">02</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Introductory Chat</h3>
          <span class="step-timeline">30 Minutes</span>
          <p>A casual, no-pressure video call. We want to hear about your background, your career goals, and what you hope to achieve during your attachment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">03</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Role-Specific Discussion</h3>
          <span class="step-timeline">45 Minutes</span>
          <p>A deeper dive into the role. For technical roles, we will review your GitHub or past projects. For operations, we will discuss real-world scenarios you might face.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">04</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Decision & Onboarding</h3>
          <span class="step-timeline">Within 1 Week</span>
          <p>We move fast. If it is a mutual fit, we will extend an offer immediately and provide a structured, 30-day onboarding plan to set you up for success.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="process-cta">
      <p>Ready to start your journey with us?</p>
      <a href="#open-roles" class="btn-process-primary">View Open Roles</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
